cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the paper (preferred-citation); if you use the shadowdollars code, also cite the software."
title: "shadow-dollars: replication package for Shadow Dollars: Stablecoin Rails, Scam Finance and the Limits of Detection in Thailand"
abstract: >-
  Collectors for public on-chain, exchange-rate, inflation and sanctions data
  with a hashed manifest; event studies with placebo-calibrated inference;
  detectors for structuring (difference-in-bunching), pass-through speed
  (dwell-time mixtures), direction-aware graph exposure, anomaly scoring and
  synthetic control; and an agent-based exchange simulator with planted mule
  accounts used to validate them by Monte Carlo.
type: software
